---
description: Oko project rules (always on)
alwaysApply: true
---
Before any change, read AGENTS.md (rules), DESIGN.md (architecture, source of truth), DATA.md (sources) and the current day's section of INSTRUCTIONS.md.
- Numbers shown to farmers come only from code (Decision.keyNumbers). Never from the LLM.
- Runtime data goes only through DataGateway (Zetaris live or snapshot). All SQL lives in src/data/queries.ts.
- Memory goes only through src/memory/hmem.ts (Meterless H-MEM).
- Simulation and decision code is pure and tested (Vitest). Pass `asOf`; use Africa/Lagos.
- Update DESIGN.md when architecture changes. Log notable prompts in docs/devlog.md.
